  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>It is a case of translation motion without rotation. The force should act at the centre of mass<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>Y</mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mtext>m</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>l</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>m</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>l</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>( considering point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;as origin )</p>",
